        "vy0": 0,
        "w0": 0
      },
      "icon": "PlanarBody.svg",
      "render": {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "PlanarBody.svg"
      },
      "help": "Rigid body: mass m, central inertia I; six states (xc, yc, phi, vx, vy, w). Named frames are body-fixed offsets from the COM."
    },
    {
